  "prefLabel": "Env-A 103.37 General state permit",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Env-A 103.37 “General state permit” means a permit that the owner or operator of a source can choose to operate under in lieu of a state permit to operate.\n\nSource. #6782-A, eff 6-30-98; renumbered by #8256 (from Env-A 101.139), see Revision Note #1 at chapter heading; renumbered by #8304 (see Revision Note #2 at chapter heading); renumbered by #9839 (from Env-A 101.92), (see Revision Note #3 at chapter heading); ss by #13105, eff 9-25-20 (formerly Env-A 101.93) (see Revision Note #4 at chapter heading for Env-A 100)",
